```

```ts
// src/lib/time.ts
import moment from 'moment';
export const startOfBusinessDay = (iso: string) => moment(iso).startOf('day').toISOString();
```

The repo already uses date-fns in src/lib/dateRange.ts. The PR adds moment only for this helper.
